While making ranged attacks, if the target is the closest eligible target, you can re-roll the Hit roll for ranged attacks.
If the target is the closest eligible target, you can re-roll the Charge roll.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Deep Strike" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">At the start of the phase, the unit has the Deep Strike ability.</characteristic>
